---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import MaturityBadge from '@components/MaturityBadge.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Cheat sheets — KasStacker"
  description="The Kaspa stack on five one-page cheat sheets — the stack, covenants, what to build and which tool. View them here, print the PDFs."
>
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <header class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Learn · cheat sheets</p>
      <h1>The stack on <em>five pages</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The whole idea, one page at a time — in full below, matching the site.
        Every sheet downloads as a PDF in dark or light (light prints best).
        Free to save, share and print.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- 01 · The stack -->
    <section class="cs" id="the-stack">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <span class="cs-n">01</span>
        <h2>The Kaspa stack</h2>
        <span class="pdfs"><a href="/sheets/dark/the-stack-dark.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF dark ↗</a><a href="/sheets/the-stack.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">light ↗</a></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-card">
        <p class="cs-sub">Each layer rests on the one below. Higher = easier to use. Lower = what enforces it.</p>
        <div class="pyramid">
          <div class="prow" style="--w: 62%; --tint: 4%">
            <b>Your project</b><span>a token, a vault, a game, an app</span>
            <i class="side">← you build here</i>
          </div>
          <div class="prow" style="--w: 72%; --tint: 8%"><b>Argent</b><span>app language — links many rules into one working app</span></div>
          <div class="prow" style="--w: 82%; --tint: 12%">
            <b>Silverscript</b><span>rule language — write "this coin can only be spent if…"</span>
            <i class="side">compiles down ↓</i>
          </div>
          <div class="prow" style="--w: 91%; --tint: 17%"><b>Kaspa Script + Covenants</b><span>the machine-level rules the network actually checks</span></div>
          <div class="prow base" style="--w: 100%"><b>Kaspa consensus</b><span>blockDAG + proof of work — confirms everything in seconds</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-note">KCC-20 tokens sit on top of the covenant layer. vProgs is the research track for the future.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 02 · What changed -->
    <section class="cs" id="move-vs-enforce">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <span class="cs-n">02</span>
        <h2>What changed</h2>
        <span class="pdfs"><a href="/sheets/dark/move-vs-enforce-dark.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF dark ↗</a><a href="/sheets/move-vs-enforce.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">light ↗</a></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-card">
        <p class="cs-sub">Kaspa used to move money. Now it can enforce rules on money too.</p>
        <div class="ba">
          <div class="ba-panel">
            <p class="ba-title">Before</p>
            <div class="flow">
              <span class="person">Alice</span>
              <span class="wire"><em>100 KAS</em></span>
              <span class="person">Bob</span>
            </div>
            <p class="ba-cap">Send coins from A to B.<br />That's it. No conditions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ba-panel now">
            <p class="ba-title">Now</p>
            <div class="flow">
              <span class="person">Alice</span>
              <span class="rules">rules<br />checked</span>
              <span class="person">Bob</span>
            </div>
            <p class="ba-cap">"Only after 30 days. Max 100 KAS."<br />The network refuses anything else.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-note">Those rules are called covenants. They live on the coins, not in a company's server.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 03 · What is a covenant -->
    <section class="cs" id="what-is-a-covenant">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <span class="cs-n">03</span>
        <h2>What is a covenant?</h2>
        <span class="pdfs"><a href="/sheets/dark/what-is-a-covenant-dark.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF dark ↗</a><a href="/sheets/what-is-a-covenant.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">light ↗</a></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-card">
        <p class="cs-sub">A lock on coins with rules built in. The whole network checks the rules, so nobody can cheat.</p>
        <div class="cov">
          <div class="lockcard">
            <span class="lock" aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
            <b>Coins with rules</b>
            <span>the rules travel with the coins</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rules-list">
            <p class="rl-title">Example rules you can attach</p>
            <p><span class="tick">✓</span> Only Alice can spend these</p>
            <p><span class="tick">✓</span> Not before 1 January</p>
            <p><span class="tick">✓</span> Max 100 KAS per day</p>
            <p><span class="tick">✓</span> Needs 2 of 3 people to agree</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="uses">
          <div><b>Vaults</b><span>savings you can't drain</span></div>
          <div><b>Escrow</b><span>pay only when delivered</span></div>
          <div><b>Tokens</b><span>supply rules nobody can bend</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 04 · Three things you can build -->
    <section class="cs" id="three-things">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <span class="cs-n">04</span>
        <h2>Three things you can build today</h2>
        <span class="pdfs"><a href="/sheets/dark/three-things-you-can-build-dark.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF dark ↗</a><a href="/sheets/three-things-you-can-build.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">light ↗</a></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-card">
        <p class="cs-sub">Pick your goal. Each one uses a different part of the stack.</p>
        <div class="three">
          <div class="tcard">
            <span class="ticon" aria-hidden="true">🪙</span>
            <b>Launch a token</b>
            <span>Fixed supply, fair launch, tradable in wallets.</span>
            <em>uses KCC-20</em>
          </div>
          <div class="tcard">
            <span class="ticon" aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
            <b>Build a vault</b>
            <span>Coins with spending rules: time locks, limits, escrow.</span>
            <em>uses Silverscript</em>
          </div>
          <div class="tcard">
            <span class="ticon" aria-hidden="true">🎮</span>
            <b>Build an app</b>
            <span>Games, markets, agents — many rules working together.</span>
            <em>uses Argent</em>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-note">All three end up as covenants on Kaspa L1 — no separate chain, no bridge.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 05 · Which tool -->
    <section class="cs" id="which-tool">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <span class="cs-n">05</span>
        <h2>Which tool do I need?</h2>
        <span class="pdfs"><a href="/sheets/dark/which-tool-dark.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF dark ↗</a><a href="/sheets/which-tool.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">light ↗</a></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-card">
        <p class="cs-sub">Answer one question at a time.</p>
        <div class="dt">
          <div class="q"><b>Just want a token?</b><span>supply, name, trading</span></div>
          <span class="yes">yes →</span>
          <div class="a"><b>KCC-20</b><span>no code needed</span></div>

          <span class="no">no ↓</span><span></span><span></span>

          <div class="q"><b>Rules on some coins?</b><span>vault, escrow, time lock</span></div>
          <span class="yes">yes →</span>
          <div class="a"><b>Silverscript</b><span>write the rule, deploy it</span></div>

          <span class="no">no ↓</span><span></span><span></span>

          <div class="q"><b>A whole app?</b><span>many parts talking to each other</span></div>
          <span class="yes">yes →</span>
          <div class="a"><b>Argent</b><span>builds on Silverscript</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="maturity">
          <p class="rl-title">Maturity today</p>
          <div class="mrow"><span>KCC-20</span><MaturityBadge maturity="production" /></div>
          <div class="mrow"><span>Kaspa Script + Covenants</span><MaturityBadge maturity="production" /></div>
          <div class="mrow"><span>Silverscript</span><MaturityBadge maturity="pre-audit" /></div>
          <div class="mrow"><span>Argent</span><MaturityBadge maturity="experimental" /></div>
          <p class="mlink">live status: <a href="/status">kasstacker.org/status</a></p>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-note">Everything ends up as covenants checked by Kaspa consensus.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="after">
      Want it interactive? The <a href="/learn">6-stop tour</a> covers the same ground with quizzes —
      and you can <a href="/learn/try-it">break a real covenant</a> yourself.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .head { padding: 56px 0 34px; }
  .head h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.5vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 800; margin: 8px 0 12px; }
  .head h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--teal); }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; }

  .cs { margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .cs-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .cs-n { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--teal); }
  .cs-head h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .pdfs { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .pdfs a {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid var(--teal-dim);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .pdfs a:hover { text-decoration: none; border-color: var(--teal); }
  .cs-card {
    background: linear-gradient(165deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 5%, var(--surface)), var(--surface) 55%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 26px 26px 20px;
  }
  .cs-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .cs-note {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    padding-top: 14px;
  }
  .rl-title {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  /* 01 — pyramid */
  .pyramid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .prow {
    position: relative;
    width: var(--w);
    min-width: min(100%, 320px);
    text-align: center;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) var(--tint, 0%), var(--surface2));
    border: 1px solid var(--teal-dim);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
  }
  .prow b { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; display: block; }
  .prow span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .prow.base { background: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); }
  .prow.base b { color: var(--teal-ink); }
  .prow.base span { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal-ink) 75%, var(--teal)); }
  .side {
    position: absolute;
    right: calc(100% + 14px);
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--faint);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .side { display: none; } }

  /* 02 — before/now */
  .ba { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .ba { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .ba-panel { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; }
  .ba-panel.now { border-color: var(--teal); }
  .ba-title { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .ba-panel.now .ba-title { color: var(--teal); }
  .flow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .person {
    width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.8rem; flex: none;
  }
  .wire { flex: 1; max-width: 120px; border-top: 2px solid var(--muted); position: relative; text-align: center; }
  .wire em { position: absolute; top: -22px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); font-style: normal; font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--faint); white-space: nowrap; }
  .wire::after { content: '▸'; position: absolute; right: -6px; top: -11px; color: var(--muted); }
  .rules {
    background: var(--teal); color: var(--teal-ink);
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.72rem;
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.25; flex: none;
  }
  .ba-cap { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.86rem; text-align: center; margin: 0; }

  /* 03 — covenant */
  .cov { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr; gap: 20px; align-items: stretch; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .cov { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .lockcard {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 16%, var(--surface2));
    border: 1px solid var(--teal-dim);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 26px 18px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .lock { font-size: 3.2rem; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .lockcard b { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; }
  .lockcard span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .rules-list p { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .tick {
    background: var(--teal); color: var(--teal-ink);
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.72rem;
    border-radius: 6px; width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    transform: translateY(2px);
  }
  .uses { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .uses { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .uses div { background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; text-align: center; }
  .uses b { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 0.92rem; display: block; }
  .uses span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }

  /* 04 — three things */
  .three { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .three { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .tcard {
    border: 1px solid var(--teal-dim); border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px 18px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-align: center;
  }
  .ticon {
    font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 16%, var(--surface2));
    border-radius: 50%; width: 62px; height: 62px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .tcard b { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .tcard span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.86rem; }
  .tcard em {
    font-style: normal; font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.76rem;
    background: var(--teal); color: var(--teal-ink);
    border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 14px; margin-top: 6px;
  }

  /* 05 — decision flow */
  .dt {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 10px 14px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .q { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; }
  .a { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 18%, var(--surface2)); border: 1px solid var(--teal); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; }
  .q b, .a b { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; display: block; }
  .q span, .a span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .yes { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--teal-bright); white-space: nowrap; }
  .no { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--faint); padding-left: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .dt { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }
    .yes { text-align: center; }
    .yes::after { content: ''; }
    .no { padding-left: 0; text-align: center; }
    .dt > span:empty { display: none; }
  }
  .maturity { border: 1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: var(--surface2); }
  .mrow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 6px 0; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .mlink { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 10px 0 0; }

  .after { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.92rem; margin-top: 8px; }
</style>
